WEBVTT

00:09.759 --> 00:10.635
Fucking hell!

00:11.219 --> 00:12.595
- Stop, you bastards!
- Run!

00:12.679 --> 00:13.972
- Asshole!
- Jun-tae, run!

00:15.390 --> 00:16.558
Hey, motherfuckers!

00:16.641 --> 00:18.518
- Stop, you fuckers!
- Assholes!

00:18.601 --> 00:19.769
Come here, assholes!

00:19.853 --> 00:21.896
- Fuckers, get back here! Fuck!
- Assholes!

00:23.815 --> 00:25.025
- Run fast!
- Hey!

00:25.108 --> 00:26.568
- Fuck!
- Stop right there!

00:26.651 --> 00:28.737
- Stop right there!
- Get them!

00:31.740 --> 00:32.615
What the fuck?

00:32.699 --> 00:33.825
Where did they go?

00:33.908 --> 00:36.036
- Shit!
- Goddamn those fuckers.

00:36.119 --> 00:38.621
You three go that way.
We'll go this way. Hurry!

00:38.705 --> 00:40.582
- Let's go quickly.
- Hurry up! Shit!

00:40.665 --> 00:42.625
- Man, those fuckers.
- You're dead! Fuck!

00:47.714 --> 00:48.798
- Jun-tae.
- Yeah?

00:49.299 --> 00:50.717
Hiding here was a good idea.

00:51.760 --> 00:55.930
This has always been the best place
to hide from bullies.

00:56.014 --> 00:56.848
Nice one.

01:00.643 --> 01:03.063
The document. Did you get it?

01:03.563 --> 01:04.397
Yeah.

01:07.734 --> 01:09.569
Don't lose it, okay?

01:10.153 --> 01:12.280
Good. Nice. Freaking nice.

01:14.324 --> 01:15.617
Hey, Jun-tae!

01:16.618 --> 01:18.787
Fucking asshole. Little fucker!

01:20.997 --> 01:21.831
Shit.

01:33.093 --> 01:34.302
Stop right there, punk!

01:36.971 --> 01:38.014
Damn!

01:39.432 --> 01:40.266
What's this?

01:42.352 --> 01:44.104
Let it go, punk. Let go.

01:47.607 --> 01:48.608
Shit!

01:49.109 --> 01:50.360
I let down my guard before.

02:06.960 --> 02:09.170
Hey, you fucking little prick. Fuck!

02:09.254 --> 02:10.922
What can you do with this?

02:14.884 --> 02:15.885
Damn!

02:18.721 --> 02:19.722
Shit!

02:20.473 --> 02:22.308
- He got him.
- Get up.

02:22.392 --> 02:24.435
Those fucking assholes.

02:24.519 --> 02:26.521
We finally caught those fuckers.

02:27.647 --> 02:28.481
Hey.

02:30.358 --> 02:31.860
What the fuck do you want?

03:03.975 --> 03:05.226
What are you doing?

03:06.394 --> 03:07.979
You crazy punk.

03:08.605 --> 03:10.273
You're part of the Union.

03:14.068 --> 03:15.570
You have to die.

04:20.218 --> 04:21.219
Son of a bitch.

04:28.559 --> 04:29.894
Hey, Park Hu-min!

04:30.603 --> 04:31.479
Baku!

04:32.605 --> 04:35.316
Hey, that's enough, you punk. Stop!

04:35.400 --> 04:36.651
I said that's enough!

04:38.069 --> 04:40.196
Hey, Jun-tae, help me stop him!

04:42.240 --> 04:45.243
That's enough!
Fucking come to your senses, asshole!

04:45.326 --> 04:47.036
Come to your senses, please!

04:50.456 --> 04:51.874
Come on! Shit!

04:53.209 --> 04:54.752
Let go of me, asshole!

04:54.836 --> 04:56.212
Hu-min, please stop!

05:02.176 --> 05:03.720
- Please! Damn it!
- Baku.

05:05.722 --> 05:06.556
Hu-min.

05:12.312 --> 05:13.479
It's Si-eun.

05:20.320 --> 05:21.529
Si-eun is…

07:04.382 --> 07:07.135
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 2

08:10.364 --> 08:11.866
Hey, don't spit it out!

08:12.658 --> 08:13.534
Hey, Hu-min.

08:13.618 --> 08:14.744
When was this, Baku?

08:14.827 --> 08:15.661
What was that?

08:16.913 --> 08:17.747
Hey!

08:18.873 --> 08:20.333
When did you film it?

08:24.170 --> 08:25.922
Hey, it's so hot! Water!

08:26.005 --> 08:27.256
Water!

08:27.798 --> 08:29.509
- I can't hear you!
- It's fucking hot!

08:30.384 --> 08:31.260
We also had

08:32.845 --> 08:34.180
good times together.

08:38.059 --> 08:39.143
But you know what?

08:42.813 --> 08:44.524
It's all pointless anyway.

08:50.905 --> 08:51.739
In the end…

08:54.033 --> 08:55.660
they'll all end up like us.

08:59.372 --> 09:00.540
Eventually…

09:02.375 --> 09:03.543
they'll get hurt

09:05.253 --> 09:06.379
and be ruined…

09:08.381 --> 09:09.382
in the same way.

09:17.306 --> 09:18.266
I'm sorry.

09:28.109 --> 09:31.070
I wasn't looking for an apology from you.

10:19.952 --> 10:21.078
How's Si-eun?

10:25.416 --> 10:27.126
He's in stable condition.

10:27.752 --> 10:29.462
So don't worry. Go home.

10:29.545 --> 10:31.422
Your parents must be waiting.

10:34.884 --> 10:35.718
It's fine.

10:36.385 --> 10:38.054
We're all Si-eun's friends.

10:39.013 --> 10:40.014
No.

10:41.849 --> 10:43.351
That isn't what I meant.

10:46.646 --> 10:47.688
Please stop…

10:49.982 --> 10:51.442
being friends with Si-eun.

10:55.821 --> 10:56.906
Please.

11:13.589 --> 11:14.423
One page

11:16.342 --> 11:17.176
is missing.

11:19.929 --> 11:21.472
I'll bring it right away.

11:31.023 --> 11:31.857
By the way…

11:34.151 --> 11:36.153
how did Hu-min end up coming to Daesung?

11:42.201 --> 11:43.869
Do I have to explain that?

11:57.883 --> 12:00.344
Get out, you fucking assholes.

12:05.307 --> 12:07.393
Hey, find those assholes quickly.

12:07.977 --> 12:08.811
Okay.

12:09.770 --> 12:11.063
Hurry up!

12:11.147 --> 12:12.106
Sons of bitches.

12:36.046 --> 12:36.881
Come eat.

12:42.678 --> 12:45.097
You're home, so you need to eat, you punk.

12:53.898 --> 12:54.732
Here.

13:11.957 --> 13:13.000
USE THIS

13:13.083 --> 13:15.252
I won't ask
where or how you got this money.

13:15.336 --> 13:16.170
Just give it back.

13:17.379 --> 13:19.215
Stop pretending to be an adult.

13:25.221 --> 13:26.055
And

13:27.139 --> 13:29.141
did you know your friends came by?

13:33.103 --> 13:36.732
One of them gave me a hard time.

13:37.233 --> 13:38.567
That punk

13:39.360 --> 13:40.611
seemed rather clever.

13:43.364 --> 13:46.075
Still, you've been living better
than I ever did.

13:48.244 --> 13:50.788
You have friends who look for you
when you can't be reached.

13:54.083 --> 13:56.585
Be good to them, kid.
They'll last forever.

14:00.506 --> 14:01.674
Guilt.

14:04.093 --> 14:04.927
What?

14:08.764 --> 14:09.598
He…

14:15.396 --> 14:17.356
Because of me, he…

14:25.823 --> 14:26.949
Because of me…

15:04.403 --> 15:06.030
Si-eun, if you were me…

15:08.490 --> 15:09.992
what would you have done?

15:16.415 --> 15:20.294
You're saying this is a record
of stolen motorcycles?

15:22.087 --> 15:25.174
Do you have a record
of this person's transactions?

15:25.925 --> 15:27.635
I don't have anything like that.

15:30.888 --> 15:32.014
In that case,

15:33.015 --> 15:34.183
I can't investigate it.

15:36.769 --> 15:37.770
For now,

15:37.853 --> 15:40.189
we'll keep this document safe.

15:40.272 --> 15:42.816
You can head home.
If we decide to investigate later--

15:42.900 --> 15:45.486
In that case, never mind.

16:02.586 --> 16:04.546
Man, fuck this. Seriously.

16:08.092 --> 16:08.926
Hello, friend.

16:11.971 --> 16:13.263
Did you go to the police?

16:17.518 --> 16:19.353
I heard you took the list of buyers.

16:37.705 --> 16:38.539
Hey, Baek-jin.

16:39.498 --> 16:40.582
I burned the list.

16:43.836 --> 16:44.670
Take it.

16:52.720 --> 16:54.430
You didn't take a photo, did you?

16:58.350 --> 16:59.768
How did you know?

17:03.188 --> 17:04.314
I don't understand.

17:07.735 --> 17:10.904
What do you think a loser like you can do?

17:13.032 --> 17:14.033
And the list?

17:15.617 --> 17:18.245
It's no use on its own.

17:20.956 --> 17:23.292
Then why are you so nervous?

17:26.462 --> 17:27.296
What?

17:27.796 --> 17:28.797
Park Hu-min.

17:29.423 --> 17:30.591
Yeon Si-eun.

17:31.967 --> 17:32.968
Go Hyun-tak.

17:35.262 --> 17:37.347
Don't mess with my friends.

17:40.601 --> 17:42.394
Then I'll delete the photo.

17:48.067 --> 17:48.984
I don't care.

17:50.861 --> 17:52.404
Then just die there.

17:58.494 --> 18:00.287
You son of a bitch.

18:00.370 --> 18:02.039
What the fuck are you doing?

18:05.334 --> 18:06.543
Come here, fucker.

18:06.627 --> 18:07.586
Son of a bitch.

18:08.087 --> 18:09.963
Bitch. Fucking asshole.

18:10.047 --> 18:11.965
Try being a smart-ass again, asswipe!

18:12.049 --> 18:12.883
Hey!

18:13.467 --> 18:15.636
- Fucker!
- Smash his head in, then he'll die!

18:16.136 --> 18:16.970
Motherfucker.

18:17.679 --> 18:18.514
Kill him.

18:20.974 --> 18:24.895
- I said kick his head in!
- He's hanging in better than I thought.

18:26.522 --> 18:27.856
Just smash his head.

18:27.940 --> 18:30.317
- Do a headbutt.
- Headbutt, my ass.

18:30.818 --> 18:32.903
You guys are fucking loud.

18:34.530 --> 18:36.198
I was trying to sleep.

18:36.782 --> 18:37.783
What's going on?

18:40.160 --> 18:41.703
Didn't he leave the Union?

18:43.080 --> 18:43.997
Fuck.

18:44.832 --> 18:45.874
What do you want?

18:49.878 --> 18:51.213
It's nice to meet you.

18:53.465 --> 18:56.093
I'm Geum Seong-je, you fucker.

18:59.263 --> 19:00.264
Hey, Eunjang.

19:03.183 --> 19:04.893
Just do as these guys say,

19:05.769 --> 19:07.271
or else you really will die.

19:09.982 --> 19:10.816
No.

19:12.609 --> 19:13.443
What?

19:16.363 --> 19:17.573
No!

19:26.623 --> 19:28.917
These Eunjang bastards.

19:29.418 --> 19:30.794
They're so fucking fun.

19:32.546 --> 19:33.422
Okay.

19:35.299 --> 19:36.466
Hats off to the romantic.

19:43.682 --> 19:45.017
What the fuck is this?

19:45.934 --> 19:47.019
Fuck!

19:47.102 --> 19:48.312
Hey, are you okay?

19:48.979 --> 19:50.439
That fucking asshole.

20:08.290 --> 20:09.416
What happened here?

20:11.627 --> 20:12.753
You got here quick.

20:17.966 --> 20:19.176
Say hi to each other.

20:24.890 --> 20:26.225
Hey, Jun-tae.

20:28.018 --> 20:29.102
Hey, can you walk?

20:30.562 --> 20:31.521
Get on my back.

20:43.367 --> 20:45.369
I never thought I'd say this to you.

20:46.536 --> 20:47.371
Thank you.

20:49.831 --> 20:51.708
Fucking bullshit.

20:55.504 --> 20:57.422
Are you really the top dog at Eunjang?

21:00.342 --> 21:03.136
That fucking loser seemed
more of a top dog than you.

21:04.388 --> 21:07.641
Same with the newbie,
Si-eun, from earlier.

21:10.435 --> 21:11.603
I know.

21:14.481 --> 21:15.315
You're right.

21:16.775 --> 21:17.651
Thank you.

21:21.488 --> 21:22.447
Let's go.

21:31.248 --> 21:32.291
Fuck.

21:33.625 --> 21:34.710
Seong-je did that?

21:37.379 --> 21:38.213
Yes, okay.

21:48.056 --> 21:49.558
You're here, Baek-jin.

21:51.226 --> 21:52.352
Have you been well?

21:56.690 --> 21:57.983
What are you doing here?

21:58.817 --> 21:59.818
What am I doing here?

22:00.485 --> 22:02.821
I'm teaching them some manners.

22:02.904 --> 22:05.949
When I asked these bastards
to bring you here,

22:06.033 --> 22:07.784
they protested and asked why.

22:09.244 --> 22:10.078
Man!

22:10.829 --> 22:13.248
They said you were busy,
and I should talk to them!

22:15.876 --> 22:17.377
I took care of everything.

22:18.003 --> 22:19.129
Don't worry.

22:19.212 --> 22:20.297
Took care of it?!

22:25.385 --> 22:26.219
No.

22:27.721 --> 22:29.389
You failed to be in control.

22:30.682 --> 22:33.602
How much longer do I have
to deal with calls from the cops?

22:37.147 --> 22:39.232
I'll handle it
so they won't trace it back--

22:39.316 --> 22:40.317
You fucking asshole.

22:57.876 --> 22:59.086
My boy.

23:01.004 --> 23:02.464
You've become a real boss.

23:04.007 --> 23:06.176
You're putting on a brave face
for the boys.

23:09.304 --> 23:10.597
If I have to return…

23:12.766 --> 23:14.267
I'll kill you.

23:33.912 --> 23:35.747
Baek-jin, that son of a bitch.

23:36.998 --> 23:38.625
He seriously crossed a line.

23:43.171 --> 23:46.091
Tak, I'm fine. Put me down.

23:50.762 --> 23:51.930
Jun-tae, are you okay?

23:52.931 --> 23:55.434
- Yeah.
- Hey, what was all that about?

23:55.934 --> 23:57.060
Why were you there?

23:57.561 --> 23:58.395
The other day,

23:59.729 --> 24:03.066
I ripped a page
out of Baek-jin's document.

24:04.067 --> 24:07.821
I… took it to the police today.

24:07.904 --> 24:10.157
Some Union guys caught me and took it.

24:13.535 --> 24:14.369
Sorry.

24:17.414 --> 24:18.331
You're also…

24:20.500 --> 24:22.169
a total lunatic at times.

24:23.378 --> 24:25.005
We're all total lunatics.

24:28.884 --> 24:30.677
Si-eun is a total lunatic too.

24:35.015 --> 24:36.516
What are you talking about?

24:38.226 --> 24:40.228
Anyway, let's get you to a doctor.

24:40.812 --> 24:41.813
- Okay?
- Okay.

24:44.024 --> 24:44.858
But

24:46.193 --> 24:47.402
I'm fine, seriously.

24:48.570 --> 24:50.238
Let's visit Si-eun first.

24:54.201 --> 24:55.285
Hey, Baku!

25:00.415 --> 25:02.167
What are you doing? Let's go.

25:04.211 --> 25:05.587
Yeah, let's go.

26:10.777 --> 26:12.362
Hey! Na Baek-jin!

26:13.697 --> 26:14.823
What's going on?

26:16.116 --> 26:17.867
Does he mean Baek-jin in Class 2?

26:17.951 --> 26:19.494
Baek-jin!

26:20.078 --> 26:21.371
- What's that?
- No idea.

26:21.955 --> 26:22.956
Na Baek-jin?

26:28.795 --> 26:30.088
Let's keep it simple.

26:30.964 --> 26:33.174
Come fight me, motherfucker!

26:35.844 --> 26:36.720
Pick the day!

26:39.848 --> 26:41.558
If Eunjang wins,

26:42.976 --> 26:45.520
you have to disband that shitty Union!

26:46.021 --> 26:47.063
You got it?

26:48.440 --> 26:49.941
Let's put an end to it!

27:07.459 --> 27:08.335
Gotak.

27:10.295 --> 27:11.129
Eunjang

27:12.464 --> 27:13.715
will fight the Union.

27:19.220 --> 27:20.639
Hey, we're seriously fucked!

27:21.556 --> 27:23.433
- What?
- What is it now?

27:23.516 --> 27:25.310
Baku is going to fight the Union.

27:25.810 --> 27:27.062
He's looking for people.

27:27.604 --> 27:31.358
- But the Union is quite tough.
- Sounds like trouble.

27:31.441 --> 27:32.984
Those guys must be crazy.

27:33.068 --> 27:34.027
They set a date.

27:34.110 --> 27:35.820
What the heck are you on about?

27:35.904 --> 27:37.697
It's all over the school.

27:38.281 --> 27:42.118
Baku went to Yeoil High
and freaking called Na Baek-jin out.

27:42.202 --> 27:44.621
Testing.

27:44.704 --> 27:45.705
It's me, Gotak.

27:46.623 --> 27:48.249
You've all heard the news, right?

27:49.125 --> 27:50.543
Aren't you fucking tired

27:50.627 --> 27:54.798
of those Union assholes picking fights
with anyone wearing our uniform?

27:57.217 --> 27:58.385
Welcome back, brother.

27:58.885 --> 28:00.136
I might not be smart,

28:01.179 --> 28:02.889
but I heard this from someone.

28:05.100 --> 28:06.476
Newton's whatever says

28:07.268 --> 28:09.312
that action is followed by reaction.

28:11.147 --> 28:12.732
Let's show them what we've got!

28:14.359 --> 28:16.861
So please help us just this once.

28:20.740 --> 28:21.574
What?

28:23.243 --> 28:24.536
Do you think I'll lose?

28:42.804 --> 28:45.807
- EUNJANG HIGH, LET'S GO
- BAKU-

28:45.890 --> 28:50.645
YEON SI-EUN

28:55.608 --> 28:57.318
We talked about guilt before.

29:00.071 --> 29:01.114
I want to apologize.

29:04.033 --> 29:04.951
To you.

29:07.746 --> 29:09.247
To Gotak and Jun-tae.

29:14.377 --> 29:15.378
And maybe even…

29:19.340 --> 29:20.383
to Baek-jin.

29:26.055 --> 29:26.890
Hey.

29:34.230 --> 29:35.106
I'm sorry.

29:40.236 --> 29:41.112
Hey.

29:45.533 --> 29:48.453
I'm sorry about before.

29:50.830 --> 29:52.040
You should…

29:54.042 --> 29:55.210
say hi to Si-eun.

30:09.182 --> 30:10.558
He's going to be fine.

30:12.685 --> 30:14.062
The doctor said

30:15.188 --> 30:16.773
he's just sleeping.

30:19.150 --> 30:19.984
What?

30:21.027 --> 30:24.113
He wasn't hit too hard by the truck.

30:25.031 --> 30:27.617
He fainted because of a shock
to his nervous system.

30:29.452 --> 30:30.620
So Si-eun's body

30:32.330 --> 30:34.165
went into a deep sleep

30:34.999 --> 30:36.835
in order to recover.

30:39.838 --> 30:40.839
Actually,

30:42.674 --> 30:44.968
he's been unable to sleep for a while.

30:50.348 --> 30:52.016
But as to when he wakes up…

30:54.018 --> 30:55.854
that depends on Si-eun's will.

31:03.486 --> 31:04.362
Beom-seok.

31:07.532 --> 31:09.117
I have to go.

31:17.458 --> 31:18.418
To your friends?

31:20.962 --> 31:22.714
You'll get hurt again.

31:23.840 --> 31:25.049
Have you forgotten?

31:25.133 --> 31:26.801
- Beom-seok!
- Si-eun.

31:36.477 --> 31:38.438
Are they more important to you than me?

31:42.567 --> 31:43.401
Well?

31:45.653 --> 31:46.905
Tell me.

31:59.542 --> 32:00.418
Beom-seok.

32:03.046 --> 32:04.339
I have to go…

32:07.884 --> 32:09.218
to my friends…

32:11.262 --> 32:12.305
and to Su-ho.

32:56.557 --> 32:58.101
Si-eun!

32:58.893 --> 32:59.727
Si-eun.

33:00.728 --> 33:01.562
My goodness.

33:02.105 --> 33:03.982
Wait here. I'll get the doctor.

33:04.857 --> 33:06.734
Don't move. You can't move yet.

33:07.276 --> 33:08.319
I have to go.

33:10.571 --> 33:12.532
I have to go to Su-ho.

33:16.995 --> 33:17.954
I have to go.

33:20.873 --> 33:22.583
I have to go to Su-ho.

33:25.753 --> 33:26.921
Si-eun.

33:27.005 --> 33:28.131
I have to go.

33:28.631 --> 33:29.799
Si-eun.

33:32.385 --> 33:33.302
Yeon Si-eun.

33:45.314 --> 33:46.149
He's fine.

33:50.153 --> 33:51.195
Your friend.

33:53.990 --> 33:55.074
I heard he's okay.

34:02.415 --> 34:03.791
Su-ho's grandmother.

34:05.710 --> 34:08.421
She kept calling your phone.

34:09.172 --> 34:10.131
So I answered.

34:12.717 --> 34:14.343
Your friend Su-ho

34:15.511 --> 34:17.597
had an unstable pulse.

34:19.891 --> 34:22.018
His grandmother couldn't answer the phone,

34:22.518 --> 34:24.145
so the hospital called you.

34:27.231 --> 34:28.608
She said she was sorry

34:29.484 --> 34:31.402
and everything is fine now,

34:32.945 --> 34:34.447
so you don't have to worry.

35:14.654 --> 35:15.530
Su-ho.

35:28.251 --> 35:29.627
I'm sorry I'm late.

35:38.219 --> 35:40.346
I had forgotten…

35:43.808 --> 35:45.351
everything you taught me.

35:49.772 --> 35:51.774
That it is great to have friends.

35:53.609 --> 35:55.194
That it is great to laugh.

36:03.953 --> 36:05.872
What you did for me…

36:13.796 --> 36:15.590
I'll try to do for others.

36:50.917 --> 36:52.043
Si-eun.

36:52.126 --> 36:53.794
Hey, how do you feel?

36:54.420 --> 36:55.421
Are you okay?

36:58.382 --> 36:59.217
Yeah.

37:00.176 --> 37:01.010
Probably.

37:11.229 --> 37:12.730
I thought that…

37:14.774 --> 37:16.442
something serious would happen.

37:19.820 --> 37:21.197
So I'm really glad.

37:24.659 --> 37:25.493
Hey, Jun-tae.

37:26.077 --> 37:28.788
A man shouldn't cry
over something like this.

37:28.871 --> 37:30.456
Si-eun woke up.

37:30.539 --> 37:32.458
- It's all good now, right?
- Yeah.

37:32.541 --> 37:34.877
There's nothing to cry about.
No more tears!

37:37.088 --> 37:38.339
Didn't you cry yesterday?

37:41.550 --> 37:42.468
Me?

37:44.679 --> 37:45.513
I did?

37:48.599 --> 37:52.061
I haven't cried since the second grade.

37:52.144 --> 37:55.940
I just have really dry eyes.
My eyes were open too long. That's all.

37:56.023 --> 37:58.859
Man, you crybaby. Did you cry again?

37:59.694 --> 38:01.654
- I didn't.
- Si-eun, don't worry.

38:01.737 --> 38:04.699
- He cries all the time.
- I didn't cry, jerk.

38:04.782 --> 38:05.616
So…

38:08.494 --> 38:09.328
what happened?

38:12.748 --> 38:13.582
With what?

38:20.256 --> 38:21.090
Na Baek-jin.

42:18.327 --> 42:22.289
Subtitle translation by: James Webb
